Package: jarvis-accounts
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvisd (= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Sign in to Jarvis with a Claude, ChatGPT, Google or GitHub Copilot account
 The exact versions (with npm integrity) of the official command-line
 programs Jarvis installs per user, on demand, when someone signs in with
 an account on @DISTRO_NAME@, and the helper that hands their sign-in page
 to your browser from inside their sandbox.
